.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt DEVTREE 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm devtree
.Nd print the kernel device tree
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the contents of
.Pa /proc/devtree
or an alternate proc-style path supplied on the command line.
It is a thin inspection tool over the kernel bus and device registry.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr proc 5
